    "unit_kind": "footnote_or_annotation"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "不良事件（AE）",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "术语定义",
      "不良事件（AE）"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-11233226bef34c28a4a2e05c",
    "package_ordinal": 77,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p985",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p985"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-a79ed8d27cd380a461295a8f",
    "unit_kind": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "不良事件（AE）指临床试验参与者在接受试验用药品之后出现的所有不良医学事件，可以表现为症状体征、疾病和/或有临床意义的实验室检查异常，但不一定与试验用药品有因果关系。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "术语定义",
      "不良事件（AE）"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-11233226bef34c28a4a2e05c",
    "package_ordinal": 77,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p986",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p986"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-25c54cb8c26bb63bc2ee981a",
    "unit_kind": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "但下列情况不应作为AE记录：",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "术语定义",
      "不良事件（AE）"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-11233226bef34c28a4a2e05c",
    "package_ordinal": 77,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p987",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p987"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-817da941f30c4b93962ccdd0",
    "unit_kind": "paragraph"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "筛选时发现的已存在的情况（例如筛选时实验室检查、心电图检查、生命体征、体格检查等结果显示具有临床意义的异常，但经由研究者判断该异常在参与者知情同意前已存在）；该种情况应作为病史/伴随疾病进行记录。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "术语定义",
      "不良事件（AE）"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-11233226bef34c28a4a2e05c",
    "package_ordinal": 77,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p988",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p988"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-37c9d17909babcfeb6751355",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "计划的住院/手术；除非计划住院/手术的情况较原有情况加重。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "术语定义",
      "不良事件（AE）"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-11233226bef34c28a4a2e05c",
    "package_ordinal": 77,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p989",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p989"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-c66377676c62953521c632dd",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "内科和外科侵入性检查（如肝脏活检、内镜检查等）；但导致需实施这些检查的疾病可能为不良事件。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "术语定义",
      "不良事件（AE）"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-11233226bef34c28a4a2e05c",
    "package_ordinal": 77,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p990",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p990"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-a225716c2306617235504444",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "研究的疾病预期进展和/或研究疾病的症状与体征出现预期进展；除非严重程度或发生频率高于预期。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
      "安全性评估",
      "术语定义",
      "不良事件（AE）"
    ],
    "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
    "package_id": "pap-11233226bef34c28a4a2e05c",
    "package_ordinal": 77,
    "role": "attached",
    "source_ref": "body.p991",
    "source_span_ids": [
      "body.p991"
    ],
    "structure_unit_id": "su-43d93af855d2fae5096669d4",
    "unit_kind": "list_item"
  },
  {
    "excerpt": "筛选时已存在的伴随疾病或原有症状、体征等出现预期的周期性波动，但并未恶化。",
    "heading_path": [
      "研究评估和程序",
